From 02ed3ad0a425c79dd51d268995005f6f41516543 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christian F.K. Schaller" <christian.schaller@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:19:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] scanner: Read what is known about scanners from a JSON file

The film scanners the portal knows, and the ranks of the drivers, were a
table in C. They are in scanner-devices.json now, which the portal reads from
the data directories and reads again when it changes, so that a distribution
or an administrator can ship a newer list without a new portal.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 data/meson.build          |   5 +
 data/scanner-devices.json |  33 +++++
 src/scanner-devices.h     |  71 -----------
 src/scanner.c             | 251 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 4 files changed, 264 insertions(+), 96 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 data/scanner-devices.json
 delete mode 100644 src/scanner-devices.h

diff --git a/data/meson.build b/data/meson.build
index bf3e2ff..2f9d254 100644
